# Rift portal driver (tools/cov/specs/riftportal.py): Temple Grounds 12_temple_finalgate has one
# portal (e00070073, inactive at load). The player stands 12 units in front of it; Activate draws
# it, Increment plays the line animation until the portal opens, shots go through its projectile
# box, AreaLoaded rebuilds the box, Decrement stops the animations, Deactivate hides it. Then the
# player steps close (the portal overfills the screen), turns its centre off-screen (copy-rect
# clamp), looks away (culled), drops from above, and lays morph-ball bombs in the projectile box
# (a kMT_Projectile actor that is not a CGameProjectile).
@f300 god 1; obj e00070073; tp 4.5 118.7 -16.6; face 0
@f340 send e00070073 Activate; obj e00070073
@f400 screenshot
@f420 send e00070073 Increment
@f480 shoot e00070073; obj e00070073
@f560 shoot e00070073 missile
@f640 shoot e00070073 charged
@f900 obj e00070073; screenshot
@f940 shoot e00070073
@f1000 send e00070073 AreaLoaded; shoot e00070073 missile
@f1060 shoot e00070073 2
@f1120 send e00070073 Decrement; obj e00070073
@f1200 send e00070073 Deactivate; obj e00070073
@f1260 send e00070073 Increment
@f1300 send e00070073 Activate; send e00070073 Increment
@f1420 tp 4.5 124.7 -16.6; face 0
@f1440 screenshot
@f1460 face 40
@f1490 face 320
@f1520 face 65
@f1550 face 295
@f1580 face 180
@f1610 tp 4.5 124.7 13.4; face 0
@f1670 tp 4.5 118.7 13.4
@f1730 tp 4.5 110.7 13.4
@f1790 face 0; tp 4.5 127.7 -16.6; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; fastmorph 1
@f1800 press x 10
@f1830 press a 4
@f1850 press a 4
@f1870 press a 4
@f1930 press x 10
@f1980 obj e00070073; objs RiftPortal
